records its own Imagine. This harness child does not itself authorize foreign
scientific work. No frozen pilot folder modification or paid API call.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] File and read back a replicator-owned request, using its own tickets
  conventions, naming the exact landed harness commit and1589/1590 lineage.
- [ ] Request a paper outside data/splits/dev-exposed-2026-11-26.csv; exposure
  exclusions cover executor/advisor/signers and answer-bearing retrieval.
- [ ] Request retained compiled report at each of the five cumulative stages,
  coherence/reuse evidence, a single updated note draft, actual scope and
  signature records, and unchanged assessment/CSV contracts. Preserve misses
  and unknowns; optional autoresume cannot block the rehearsal.
- [ ] Request a frozen skill commit/version for the Brodeur batch, cited by
  each AI Disclosure; report1580 report-style dispositions and mapping lifetime.
- [ ] Record receiver ticket/branch/head and notify live owner; report pending
  pickup honestly.1589 stays open until actual rehearsal and freeze evidence
  are read back and integration verified; handoff filing alone is not success.

Verification is payload/ownership/scope readback, not new estimates in harness.
Any author scope or signature still required by the paper run remains required.
